# model-tiers — resolved model slugs for cheap / standard / judgment work.
# Skills and delegation rules name TIERS only; never hardcode vendor model names.
#
# Precedence (highest wins):
#   1. Process env from the active runtime's settings.json `env` block
#   2. Plugin defaults in skills/model-tiers/defaults.env (shipped with the plugin)
#
# Keys (all optional overrides — unset keys fall back to defaults.env):
AI_MODEL_CHEAP=
AI_MODEL_STANDARD=
AI_MODEL_JUDGMENT=
#
# --- Illustrative Cursor overrides (commented; copy into ~/.cursor/settings.json env) ---
# AI_MODEL_CHEAP=composer-2.5-fast
# AI_MODEL_STANDARD=claude-sonnet-5-thinking-high
# AI_MODEL_JUDGMENT=claude-opus-5-thinking-high
#
# Same keys work in ~/.claude/settings.json and ~/.codex/settings.json when supported.
# jq snippets to view or set values → skills/model-tiers/reference.md
